\n        <div id=\"outerWrapper\"><header class=\"header clearfix\"><div class=\"header--js-offset\"><div class=\"header__meta\"><div class=\"global__item--centered clearfix\"><ul class=\"nav--meta\"><li><a href=\"/en/presse\">Press</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/contact\">Contact</a></li></ul><ul class=\"lang\"><li><a href=\"/infos-fuer-promovierende/promotionsfoerderung-der-studienstiftung\">DE</a></li><li><span>EN</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"header__navbar global__item--centered clearfix\"><a href=\"https://www.studienstiftung.de/\" id=\"logo\"><img src=\"/_assets/cceea97385d0fcd2526e519a5ac127bd/Images/logo.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive\" /></a><span class=\"trigger--menu-open js__trigger--menu hidden-md hidden-lg\">Navigation \u00f6ffnen</span></div><div class=\"header__menu\"><span class=\"trigger--menu-close js__trigger--menu trigger--hide hidden-md hidden-lg\">Schlie\u00dfen</span><nav class=\"nav nav--header\"><ul class=\"nav__wrapper global__item--centered-desktop clearfix\"><li class=\"nav__item sub\"><span class=\"menu__item\">STUDIENSTIFTUNG<span class=\"trigger--nav-item js__trigger--nav-item\"></span></span><ul class=\"nav--second js__nav--toggle\"><div class=\"global__item--centered-desktop\"><ul><li class=\"nav__item sub\"><a href=\"/en/about-us\">About us</a><ul class=\"hidden--menu clearfix\"><li class=\"nav__item\"><a href=\"/en/facts-and-figures\">Facts and figures</a></li><li class=\"nav__item\"><a href=\"/en/leitbild\">Mission Statement</a></li></ul><span class=\"trigger--toggle\"></span></li></ul></div></ul></li><li class=\"nav__item sub\"><span class=\"menu__item\">SCHOLARSHIPS<span class=\"trigger--nav-item js__trigger--nav-item\"></span></span><ul class=\"nav--second js__nav--toggle\"><div class=\"global__item--centered-desktop\"><ul><li class=\"nav__item sub\"><a href=\"/en/doctoral-scholarships\" class=\"act\">Doctoral scholarships</a><ul class=\"hidden--menu clearfix\"><li class=\"nav__item\"><a href=\"/en/doctoral-scholarships/doctoral-scholarships\" class=\"act\">Doctoral scholarships</a></li><li class=\"nav__item\"><a href=\"/en/doctoral-scholarships/the-marianne-plehn-program-to-support-doctoral-candidates-in-bavaria\">The Marianne-Plehn-Program to support doctoral candidates in Bavaria</a></li></ul><span class=\"trigger--toggle\"></span></li><li class=\"nav__item sub\"><a href=\"/en/stipendienprogramme\">Open programmes</a><ul class=\"hidden--menu clearfix\"><li class=\"nav__item\"><a href=\"/en/erp\">ERP</a></li><li class=\"nav__item\"><a href=\"/en/karl-schmidt-rottluff\">Karl Schmidt-Rottluff Scholarship</a></li><li class=\"nav__item\"><a href=\"/en/mccloy\">McCloy Programm</a></li><li class=\"nav__item\"><a href=\"/en/leo-baeck-fellowship\">Leo Baeck Fellowship</a></li><li class=\"nav__item\"><a href=\"https://www.toepfer-stiftung.de/de/was-wir-tun/you-and-europe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">You and Europe - European Scholarship Programme (Toepfer Stiftung)</a></li></ul><span class=\"trigger--toggle\"></span></li></ul></div></ul></li></ul></nav></div><div class=\"header__search hidden-xs hidden-sm\"></div></div></header><div class=\"mood\"><img src=\"/pool/sdv/private/mood/studienstiftung_stipendium_mood.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"mood img-responsive\" /><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;max-width:1920px;margin:0 auto;\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mood-copy btn--caption text-semi\" data-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-placement=\"left\" data-container=\"body\" title=\"[Translate to Englisch:] \u00a9 Johannes Haas/Studienstiftung\">&copy;</button></span></div><div class=\"global__item--centered clearfix\"><ul class=\"hidden-xs hidden-sm clearfix\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><li class=\"active\"><a href=\"/en/\" title=\"Home\" class=\"active\">Home</a></li><li class=\"active\"><a href=\"\" title=\"Scholarships\" class=\"active\">Scholarships</a></li><li class=\"active\"><a href=\"/en/doctoral-scholarships\" title=\"Doctoral scholarships\" class=\"active\">Doctoral scholarships</a></li><li class=\"active current\">\nDoctoral scholarships\n</li></ul><div id=\"content\"><div class=\"path clearfix\"><h2>Doctoral scholarships&nbsp;/&nbsp;</h2><h1>Doctoral scholarships</h1></div><!-- TYPO3SEARCH_begin --><a class=\"anchor\" name=\"c5004\" id=\"c5004\"></a><div class=\"cType_def cType_text clearfix\"><p><strong>Current notices</strong></p><p>The number of applications for doctoral scholarships has increased significantly since 2024. To ensure applications continue to be processed within an appropriate timeframe, the Studienstiftung is adjusting its application procedure: From now on, we will publish calls for applications approximately eight months before each selection meeting. Each call remains open for two weeks (exactly 14 days). There is no limit to the number of applications we accept. All complete applications received during a call will be included in the selection procedure.</p><p>Please send us your <strong>complete application documents via mail</strong>. Please send us your application documents printed on one side only and without staples, paper clips, folders, or similar items. Our mailing address is:&nbsp;</p><p>Studienstiftung des deutschen Volkes<br>Team Promotionsf\u00f6rderung<br>Ahrstr. 41<br>53175 Bonn</p></div><a class=\"anchor\" name=\"c5016\" id=\"c5016\"></a><div class=\"content__bg box btflex\"><div class=\"global__item--centered\"><div class=\"row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3\"><div class=\"col grid-item\"><a class=\"anchor\" name=\"c5019\" id=\"c5019\"></a><div class=\"cType_def cType_text clearfix\"><p><i><strong>Opening of the Call</strong></i></p><p>1-14 October 2026</p><p>1-14 February 2027</p><p>1-14 June 2027</p><p>1-14 October 2027&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class=\"col grid-item\"><a class=\"anchor\" name=\"c5018\" id=\"c5018\"></a><div class=\"cType_def cType_text clearfix\"><p><i><strong>For the selection meeting</strong></i></p><p>in May 2027</p><p>in September 2027</p><p>in January 2028</p><p>in May 2028&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class=\"col grid-item\"><a class=\"anchor\" name=\"c5017\" id=\"c5017\"></a><div class=\"cType_def cType_text clearfix\"><p><i><strong>Earliest possible start of scholarship</strong></i></p><p>1 July 2027</p><p>1 October 2027</p><p>1 April 2028</p><p>1 July 2028&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></div><a class=\"anchor\" name=\"c5020\" id=\"c5020\"></a><div class=\"cType_def cType_text clearfix\"><p>Our new application procedure provides full transparency and planning reliability for applicants while making the workload more predictable for reviewers and members of the selection committee.</p></div><a class=\"anchor\" name=\"c2280\" id=\"c2280\"></a><div class=\"list-view\"><h3><a href=\"/en/doctoral-scholarships/doctoral-scholarships/academic-support\">Academic support</a></h3><p>The Studienstiftung's academic support includes summer academies, research groups, language courses, workshops and supervision by liaison professors.</p></div><div class=\"list-view\"><h3><a href=\"/en/finanzen0\">Financial support</a></h3><p>The Studienstiftung offers generous financial support for Ph.D. students. Additional funds are provided for research and travel abroad.</p></div><div class=\"list-view\"><h3><a href=\"/en/promotionsvorschlag\">Application</a></h3><p>Highly qualified and socially committed PhD students may, together with their supervisors, submit an application for support for their doctoral studies.</p></div><div class=\"list-view\"><h3><a href=\"/en/doctoral-scholarships/doctoral-scholarships/frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></h3><p>Here you can find answers to frequently asked questions about requirements, application and funding concerning the Studienstiftung\u2019s doctoral scholarships. </p></div><!-- TYPO3SEARCH_end --></div></div><div class=\"teaser\"><div class=\"global__item--centered clearfix\"><div class=\"row\"></div></div></div></div><footer id=\"footer\"><div class=\"global__item--centered clearfix\"><a class=\"anchor\" name=\"c1360\" id=\"c1360\"></a><div class=\"cType_def cType_text clearfix\"><ul class=\"text-center\"><li class=\"inline-center\">Sitemap</li><li class=\"inline-center\"><a href=\"https://www.studienstiftung.de/en/legal-notice\">Legal Notice</a></li><li class=\"inline-center\"><a href=\"https://www.studienstiftung.de/en/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a></li><li class=\"inline-center\"><a href=\"https://www.studienstiftung.de/en/disclaimer\">Disclaimer</a></li></ul></div></div></footer>\n    \n    \n\n\n            <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/_assets/cceea97385d0fcd2526e519a5ac127bd/Css/default.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n        \n\n            <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/_assets/cceea97385d0fcd2526e519a5ac127bd/Css/print.css\" media=\"print\" />\n        \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/typo3temp/assets/vhs/vhs-assets-magnific-styles.css\" />\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/_assets/cceea97385d0fcd2526e519a5ac127bd/JavaScript/jquery-1.11.3.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/typo3temp/assets/vhs/vhs-assets-bootstrap-js.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/typo3temp/assets/vhs/vhs-assets-fancybox.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/typo3temp/assets/vhs/vhs-assets-custom-flowtype-match-height.js\"></script></body>\n</html>\n", "http_status": 200, "error": "", "final_url": "https://www.studienstiftung.de/en/doctoral-scholarships/doctoral-scholarships"}